1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,560
San Marcos Kapitulo 4

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,900
At damay sa atao, anapan nagpurwak ka dagiti bukel.

3
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:37,480
Idi agipurpurwak.

4
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:42,000
Nagdiso ti sumagmamano a bukel itiigid tidalan,

5
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,740
ket tinuktok dagiti tumatayab.

6
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,680
At damit sumagmamano a bukel,

7
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:51,900
anagdiso itikabatwan abasitlaeng tidagana.

8
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:54,780
Gaputan na rabaw tidagana,

9
00:00:56,120 --> 00:00:58,200
nabiit anagtubo dagiti bukel.

10
00:00:58,760 --> 00:00:59,880
Idi makatulog,

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,380
at ang kaya gantiinit,

12
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:05,040
na laylay dagiti apagtubo amula,

13
00:01:05,880 --> 00:01:07,760
ket naganguda adagos.

14
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:09,360
Agsipod,

15
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:11,380
tadi daunay nakapagramot.

16
00:01:12,100 --> 00:01:14,300
Nagdiso ti sumagmamano a bukel,

17
00:01:14,580 --> 00:01:17,980
itinagtubuan dagiti siitan amula adimakel,

18
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:20,020
ken nang lepes kadakwada.

19
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:21,600
Itikasta,

20
00:01:22,500 --> 00:01:24,540
saan anakapagdawa dagiti mula?

21
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:27,240
Ngayom adadagiti bukel,

22
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:29,640
anagdiso itinadamag adaga.

23
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
Ket nagtubo,

24
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,500
dimakel,

25
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:35,500
ken nagdawada.

26
00:01:35,500 --> 00:01:38,500
Adda nagdawa ititalo pulo.

27
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:40,500
At damit innamapulo,

28
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:43,500
ken adapay sangagasot.

29
00:01:43,500 --> 00:01:45,500
Ket ingibus nihesus.

30
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:50,500
Dumngeg ngarod ti siya sinuman nga adaan pannakaawat.

31
00:01:51,500 --> 00:01:54,000
Idi agmaymaysa nihesus,

32
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:57,500
na pan ken kuanati sumagmamano kadagiti nagdenggeg,

33
00:01:57,500 --> 00:01:59,700
agraman dagiti sangapulo kitdwa nga adaan.

34
00:01:59,700 --> 00:02:02,700
Kinid daw da nga ilawlawag na dagiti pang ngarig.

35
00:02:02,700 --> 00:02:04,700
Kinunan nihesus.

36
00:02:29,700 --> 00:02:32,700
No mailasin ken maawatanda,

37
00:02:32,700 --> 00:02:35,700
amangan no agsublida iti Diyos,

38
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:37,700
ket pakawanin nanto ida.

39
00:02:37,700 --> 00:02:41,200
Diyo ay ang maawatanda ito'y apang ngarig.

40
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:44,200
Sinalutsod nihesus kadakwada.

41
00:02:44,200 --> 00:02:46,200
No diyo maawatanda,

42
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:50,200
kasa nungarod ang maawatanyo ti uray anya apang ngarig.

43
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:53,200
Ket inlawlawag na ti pang ngarig.

44
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,200
Tiagmul mula,

45
00:02:55,200 --> 00:02:57,700
iwaragawag na ti saot Diyos.

46
00:02:57,700 --> 00:02:59,700
Dagiti bukel,

47
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:01,700
anagdiso iti dalang,

48
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:06,700
mayarig da kadagiti tattao amakang ngarg iti saot Diyos.

49
00:03:06,700 --> 00:03:09,700
Apaman amang ngarg da?

50
00:03:09,700 --> 00:03:11,700
Umay ni satanas,

51
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:15,700
ket ikaten na ti mensahe kadakwada.

52
00:03:15,700 --> 00:03:18,700
Dagiti da duma at tattao,

53
00:03:18,700 --> 00:03:23,700
mayarig da kadagiti bukel anagdiso iti kabatuan.

54
00:03:23,700 --> 00:03:26,700
Apaman amang ngarg dati sao?

55
00:03:26,700 --> 00:03:29,700
Awaten da asiraragsak.

56
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:33,700
Ngayom saan ang makapagramot ti sao kadakwada?

57
00:03:33,700 --> 00:03:36,700
Ket saan da ngaagbayag?

58
00:03:36,700 --> 00:03:39,700
Isot ga po na ama upay da adagos,

59
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:41,700
nudumteng dagiti rigrigat,

60
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:43,700
ken pan nakaidadanes,

61
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,700
ga po iti sao.

62
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:48,700
Ket dagiti da duma at tattao,

63
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:51,700
mayarig da kadagiti bukel,

64
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:55,700
anagdiso iti nagtubuan dagiti siitan amulmula.

65
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:57,700
Iso da dagitoy,

66
00:03:57,700 --> 00:03:59,700
imakangag iti sao.

67
00:03:59,700 --> 00:04:03,700
Ngayom umay dagiti pakaring guran iti daytoy abyag.

68
00:04:03,700 --> 00:04:06,700
Ti panagagom iti kinabaknang,

69
00:04:06,700 --> 00:04:11,700
ken tinalabas apa nagtari gagay kadagiti da duma pay abambanag.

70
00:04:11,700 --> 00:04:14,700
Ket lipasin da ti sao.

71
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:15,700
Itikasta,

72
00:04:15,700 --> 00:04:17,700
di da makapagbunga.

73
00:04:17,700 --> 00:04:20,700
Ngayom dagiti da duma at tattao,

74
00:04:20,700 --> 00:04:25,700
mayarig da kadagiti bukel anagdiso iti nadamag adaga.

75
00:04:25,700 --> 00:04:28,700
Ipapuso da adeng gan ti sao,

76
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:30,700
ket agbunga da.

77
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:33,700
Adagbunga iti talupulo,

78
00:04:33,700 --> 00:04:35,700
at damit inamapulo,

79
00:04:35,700 --> 00:04:37,700
ken adapay sangagasot.

80
00:04:37,700 --> 00:04:39,700
Intuloy ni Jesus,

81
00:04:39,700 --> 00:04:42,700
Gangtan aya ti pagsilawan,

82
00:04:42,700 --> 00:04:44,700
tap no kaluban iti salop,

83
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:46,700
wen no ipasirok iti katre.

84
00:04:46,700 --> 00:04:50,700
Saan aya nga ikabil kit di itinairanta apagyanan na?

85
00:04:50,700 --> 00:04:54,700
Awan tinailim mong adinto mailatak.

86
00:04:55,700 --> 00:04:58,700
Awan met ti palimid adi maamuan.

87
00:04:58,700 --> 00:05:03,700
Dumnag ngarod ti siya sinuman nga adaan pan nakaawat.

88
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,700
Kinunanapay kadakwada,

89
00:05:05,700 --> 00:05:09,700
panunuten nyo analaing timangnagyo.

90
00:05:09,700 --> 00:05:13,700
No kasanot ti panangrokod yo kadagiti sabsabali,

91
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:16,700
kastan tumet ti panangrokod ti Diyos kadakayo,

92
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:19,700
ket naing inget tupay.

93
00:05:19,700 --> 00:05:21,700
Tati adaan,

94
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:23,700
maikanto iti adado.

95
00:05:23,700 --> 00:05:25,700
Ngayom ti awanan,

96
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:28,700
uray ti basit nga daken kwana,

97
00:05:28,700 --> 00:05:30,700
maikat tupay.

98
00:05:30,700 --> 00:05:33,700
Intuloy ni Jesus tinagsaw,

99
00:05:33,700 --> 00:05:37,700
Kastoy ti kayarigan ti pagaryan ti Diyos.

100
00:05:37,700 --> 00:05:42,700
Adda taong agpurwak kadagiti bukel iti talon na.

101
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,700
Maturog iti rabii,

102
00:05:44,700 --> 00:05:47,700
ket agtrabaho iti aldaw.

103
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,700
Kabayatan na,

104
00:05:49,700 --> 00:05:53,700
agtubo dagiti bukel ket dumakkal da.

105
00:05:53,700 --> 00:05:55,700
Ngayom diam mo tinagmula,

106
00:05:55,700 --> 00:05:59,700
no kasanot ti irurusing ken idadakkel da.

107
00:05:59,700 --> 00:06:02,700
Tidagamit laing timangpadakkel,

108
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:05,700
ken mangpabunga kadagiti mula.

109
00:06:05,700 --> 00:06:08,700
Agparang nga umunat ibulong.

110
00:06:08,700 --> 00:06:11,700
Sumaruno ti dawa.

111
00:06:11,700 --> 00:06:13,700
Ket kamaudyanan na,

112
00:06:13,700 --> 00:06:15,700
mamsek ti dawa.

113
00:06:15,700 --> 00:06:18,700
Numatangkinanin dagiti dawa,

114
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:21,700
rugyanin ti aggapas,

115
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:24,700
tadimtengen ti panagapit.

116
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:30,700
Anya ti pangyarigan tayo iti pagaryan ti Diyos?

117
00:06:30,700 --> 00:06:34,700
Anya pang ngarig ti pangilawlawag tayo iti daytoy?

118
00:06:34,700 --> 00:06:39,700
Mayarig iti bukel ti mustasa akabasitan abukel dito'y lubong.

119
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:42,700
Basit usit abukel,

120
00:06:42,700 --> 00:06:44,700
ngayom numaimula,

121
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:45,700
dumakkal,

122
00:06:45,700 --> 00:06:49,700
ket agbalin akadakkelan kadagiti amin amulmula.

123
00:06:49,700 --> 00:06:51,700
Agsa nga iti dadakkel,

124
00:06:51,700 --> 00:06:54,700
amabalin apagumukan dagiti tumatayab.

125
00:06:54,700 --> 00:06:57,700
Babaen kadagiti kakastoy apang ngarig,

126
00:06:57,700 --> 00:07:01,700
ikas kasaba ni Jesus ti mensahe na kadagiti tattao,

127
00:07:01,700 --> 00:07:04,700
kas iti kabailanda nga umawat.

128
00:07:04,700 --> 00:07:05,700
Saan nga agsa o,

129
00:07:05,700 --> 00:07:06,700
idi kadakwada,

130
00:07:06,700 --> 00:07:09,700
nu di na aramaten dagiti pang ngarig.

131
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:12,700
Ngayom na isisudalaing kadagiti adalan na,

132
00:07:12,700 --> 00:07:14,700
ilawlawag na amin kadakwada.

133
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:17,700
Idi sumipngeten iti daytamit lang aldaw,

134
00:07:17,700 --> 00:07:18,700
kinuna ni Jesus,

135
00:07:18,700 --> 00:07:20,700
kadagiti adalan na,

136
00:07:20,700 --> 00:07:22,700
Bumalasyo tayo.

137
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:24,700
Pinanawan na nga ro'n dagiti tattao,

138
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:27,700
sa dalimugan itibangka nga ayan ni Jesus,

139
00:07:27,700 --> 00:07:29,700
kitbim malasyo da,

140
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:33,700
at dapay sabsabali abilog anakikuyog ken kwana.

141
00:07:33,700 --> 00:07:36,700
Pag amuan na gangin itinakapigpigsa,

142
00:07:36,700 --> 00:07:39,700
iti maod dagiti dadakkel adanluyon,

143
00:07:39,700 --> 00:07:41,700
anang sabwasabwag itibangka.

144
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:43,700
Itikasta,

145
00:07:43,700 --> 00:07:46,700
nganganin mapno itibangka itidanom,

146
00:07:46,700 --> 00:07:49,700
agda ni Jesus itikutit tibangka,

147
00:07:49,700 --> 00:07:51,700
matmaturo ang nakapungan.

148
00:07:51,700 --> 00:07:53,700
Riniing dagiti adalan na,

149
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:55,700
Maestro!

150
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:56,700
Kinunada,

151
00:07:56,700 --> 00:08:00,700
Awan ayat ang nyaman nakin ka nulumnad tayo?

152
00:08:00,700 --> 00:08:01,700
Bimbango ni Jesus,

153
00:08:01,700 --> 00:08:03,700
kit binilin na tiangin,

154
00:08:03,700 --> 00:08:05,700
Agsardeng ka!

155
00:08:05,700 --> 00:08:07,700
Sana kinuna itidaluyon,

156
00:08:07,700 --> 00:08:09,700
Agtal na ka!

157
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:11,700
Nagsardeng tiangin,

158
00:08:11,700 --> 00:08:13,700
kit nagtal na tidaluyon.

159
00:08:13,700 --> 00:08:15,700
Kinuna ni Jesus kadagiti adalan,

160
00:08:15,700 --> 00:08:17,700
Apay ngagbuteng kayo!

161
00:08:17,700 --> 00:08:20,700
Awan pay kaditi pang matiyo?

162
00:08:20,700 --> 00:08:22,700
Ngim kastaunay itibutingda,

163
00:08:22,700 --> 00:08:25,700
kit kinunada itimaysa kenmaysa.

164
00:08:25,700 --> 00:08:27,700
Anya't ikatataon na rito'y,

165
00:08:27,700 --> 00:08:29,700
uray tiangin kong tidaluyon

166
00:08:29,700 --> 00:08:32,700
agtong palda kenkwana.

